  {
    "id": 2801005010080,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "見て見てプロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1048010020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010090,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "この子はダンスが世界レベルで、\r\nパフォーマンス動画を無限に見てられる子！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010100,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "あっちの子は今テレビに引っ張りだこ！\r\nビジュアルだけじゃなくてトークまで可愛いの！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、そうか\r\nよく知ってるなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010110,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "当然だよ！\r\nアイドル、好きだもん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010120,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "……っていうか、むしろプロデューサーが大丈夫？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010130,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "よく考えなくても、\r\n私が知ってるレベルの知識で感心してたらダメじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010140,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "仮にもアイドルのプロデューサーでしょ……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おっ、そうくるか\r\nなら、言われっぱなしじゃいられないなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺はこの子のライブを\r\nリハーサルから見学させてもらったことがあるんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010150,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "えっすごい！\r\nどうだった……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "プロ意識の高い子だなって思ったよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "照明の当て方からカメラでの撮り方まで\r\n細部もよく確認して進めてた",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010160,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "うわーっ、やっぱそうなんだ。さすが……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010170,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "プロデューサー！\r\nそういう裏話的なの、もっといける……！？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "知ってる子の話ならな\r\n──えっとたとえば……あ、向こうのユニットとか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010180,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "うんうんうん……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010180"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
