  {
    "id": 2801005010190,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "はー……！　すごいなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010200,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "いつかＢ小町も、こういう展示を出してもらえるように\r\nなりたいなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なれるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00758",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800,
    "bgEffectTime": 800
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010210,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "簡単に言ってくれるぅ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010220,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "自分でもわかってるんだよ？\r\nまだまだ認知度が足りないってこと",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010230,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "クラスの子なんてみんなすごいんだから！\r\n私浮いちゃってないか心配になるレベルだし",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "気にしなくていいと思うけどな\r\nルビーはもう立派なアイドルだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010240,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "もー！　次元が違うの！\r\nこっちには不知火フリルちゃんだっているんだからね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、どんな張り合い方なんだ？　それ\r\n──まぁ、それでもさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺はルビーも、負けないぐらいの才能だって思ってるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010250,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010260,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "それは……、ありがとう、だけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2801005010270,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "……プロデューサー、\r\n結構恥ずかしい人だねとか、言われない？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/280100501/2801005010270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
